flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T19:50:47.0892893Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T19:50:47.0893608Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T19:50:47.0893870Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T19:50:47.0894084Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T19:50:47.0894714Z 
